; --- Run info, RIGHT page. RunController (procedural_base) writes here via
; NodePath ../FieldJournal/Book/Pages/RunDebugLabel. Dark text (index 30) so it
; reads on the cream page; word-wrapped to the page width. font_size 8 = the
; pixel-font native em (see ui_font_pixel_grid).
[node name="RunDebugLabel" type="Label" parent="Book/Pages"]
